      "flowchartPage": 13,
      "flowchartImage": "./assets/flowcharts/l11/l11-flow-p13.png",
      "sourceText": "[PDF page 13]\n2026-07-23\nError 020023037_000526\nBack to error list\nLast Updated: 8/21/2025\nStation: FLA\nError Description: GBCDB string is blank\nError Description: Board FRU area checksum failed integrity check. Product FRU area checksum failed integrity check.\nComment: Failure to read CBC EEPROM Properly\nFail Message (MODS.log/tas.txt):\n2025-06-22T08:45:16.169688-06:00 Top Level (top_OberonGB_DGX_72GPU_fla) > compute_node_17 {{N:FAIL}}\nFA Steps\n1. Remove tray\na. Inspect cable cartridge\nb. Inspect tray connector\nc. Reseat tray\n2. Replace tray\nReplacing CBC1\nIf CBC1 is replaced after FLB has been run, SWITCH_1 must be factory reset by ssh-ing to the host (nvos) and running:\nnv action reset system factory-default\nFlowchart\n020023037_000526 - FA Flow\nPass Continue Test Flow\nRetest\nInspect CBC and Fail\nRemove Tray\ntray connectors\nReplace Tray\n13 / 80"
